      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "skeleton by reference;",
      "bbox": [
        47.0,
        286.587,
        168.667,
        302.587
      ],
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-n70",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "The second skeleton is shorter than the first; and",
      "bbox": [
        55.667,
        259.92,
        317.0,
        274.587
      ],
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-n71",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "The substantial analytical and drafting work had already been completed in preparation of the first skeleton:",
      "bbox": [
        46.333,
        212.587,
        572.0,
        249.253
      ],
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-n72",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "The Defendant further contends that client attendances of three hours were unnecessary; given that the issues raised in the Renewed Application were unchanged from the Initial Application.",
      "bbox": [
        24.0,
        162.587,
        572.667,
        198.92
      ],
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-n73",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "There is force in the Defendant's submissions. A total of 34 hours is an excessive amount of time for the preparation of a skeleton which dealt with substantially the same issues as a skeleton which had been prepared and filed in opposition to the Initial Application:",
      "bbox": [
        24.0,
        93.92,
        571.667,
        150.92
      ],
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "0471e83c1ea18086cfb6b3ff51da6f22b0efee337f10315b2593f782297ccb84-n74",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "7 . A reasonable amount proportionate to the work involved is AED 44,000.00 (approximately USD 12,000) and the Claimant's costs will be assessed in that amount.",
      "bbox": [
